`osm2rail` is very much a work in progress. Provided an `.osm.pbf` file, such as can be obtained from Geofabrik, it converts it into a meaningful representation for rail networks.

Start up an empty pg that has pgrouting and postgis installed
```
docker run -d --restart=unless-stopped \
    -p 5432:5432 \
    -e POSTGRES_USER=admin \
    -e POSTGRES_PASSWORD=pw \
    -e POSTGRES_DB=db \
    -d \
    pgrouting/pgrouting:17-3.5-3.7
```